0,Otoro language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otoro_language,"The Kwara variety is the most prominently represented in the Otoro language, on which Stevenson's book Tira and Otoro is based. Furthermore, in the Kwara mountain group, the town of Sabun, known as the home of the Mek, holds a high political status as Mek denotes the chief of the Otoro.",Otoro,Niger-Congo
1,Music of the Democratic Republic of the Congo - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo,"In both the former French Congo (now the Republic of the Congo) and Belgian Congo (now Democratic Republic of the Congo), the popular partnered dance music was initially known as maringa.",Otoro,Niger-Congo
