5,Otoro language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/otoro_language,"The Otoro language (autonym: Ḏuṯuɽu), also known as Dhitoro, Kawama, or Litoro, is an endangered Niger-Congo language spoken primarily by the Otoro people in the Nuba Mountains of Southern Kordof",Otoro,Niger-Congo
